# RAG Chatbot - Retrieval-Augmented Generation System

A comprehensive RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) Chatbot that answers queries based on custom documents using advanced NLP, semantic chunking, embeddings, and vector similarity search.

## ✅ Implementation Complete

This repository contains a **fully functional RAG chatbot** with all the requested features implemented.

## 🚀 Quick Start

```bash
# 1. Setup
./setup.sh && source venv/bin/activate

# 2. Configure (add your API key to .env)
cp .env.example .env
nano .env

# 3. Ingest documents
python main.py --ingest "TheUdyog Brochure.pdf"

# 4. Start chatting
python main.py --chat
```

See [QUICKSTART.md](QUICKSTART.md) for detailed setup instructions.

## 📋 Implemented Features

### ✅ Document Ingestion & Cleaning
- Multi-format support: PDF, TXT, CSV, HTML, Markdown
- Advanced NLP preprocessing:
  - Text normalization (lowercasing, punctuation removal)
  - Stopword removal
  - Lemmatization and stemming
  - Removal of URLs, emails, special characters

### ✅ Semantic Chunking
- Intelligent sentence-aware chunking
- Configurable chunk size and overlap
- Metadata preservation (source, position, document title)
- Context-aware splitting

### ✅ Embedding Generation
- SentenceTransformers support (free, local)
- OpenAI embeddings support
- Batch processing for efficiency
- Multiple model options

### ✅ Vector Storage (ChromaDB)
- Persistent vector database
- Metadata filtering
- Fast similarity search
- Document management APIs

### ✅ Query Processing & Retrieval
- Semantic similarity search
- Metadata-based filtering
- Top-K retrieval
- Context building

### ✅ Re-ranking & Enhancement
- BM25 re-ranking
- Cross-Encoder re-ranking
- Hybrid scoring (vector + lexical)
- Source attribution

### ✅ Response Generation
- Multiple LLM providers:
  - Anthropic Claude (Sonnet, Opus)
  - OpenAI GPT (GPT-4, GPT-3.5)
  - Local models (Hugging Face)
- Conversation memory
- Context-aware responses
- Streaming support ready

